        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Otto%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By the 1870s, Otto boasted seven cheese factories, a testament to its dairy heritage.",
